      </text>
      <rect class="dg-cell" x="8" y="254" width="150" height="30" rx="6"></rect>
      <text class="dg-mono" x="16" y="274">
        A77D ADC $1A7F
      </text>
      <path class="dg-arrow dg-dash" d="M83 62V180" marker-end="url(#dg-arrowhead)"></path>
      <text class="dg-small" x="90" y="124">
        돌아오면
      </text>
      <text class="dg-small" x="90" y="140">
        여기부터
      </text>

      <text class="dg-text dg-bold" x="196" y="16">
        뱅크 $1E (빈 곳)
      </text>
      <rect class="dg-cool" x="196" y="28" width="156" height="34" rx="6"></rect>
      <text class="dg-mono" x="204" y="50">
        8000 WordWrap:
      </text>
      <rect class="dg-cell" x="196" y="70" width="156" height="58" rx="6"></rect>
      <text class="dg-text" x="204" y="92">
